      <title>从原始PPG信号自建压力评分引擎：告别智能手表黑箱算法</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E4%BB%8E%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8BPPG%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E8%87%AA%E5%BB%BA%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B%E8%AF%84%E5%88%86%E5%BC%95%E6%93%8E%E5%91%8A%E5%88%AB%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%A8%E9%BB%91%E7%AE%B1%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/</link>
